  "details": "When in an instance, the HUD has a hamburger button on the botton right of the screen. The edge-to-edge display of iPhones makes it easy to accidentally trigger while playing. One of the menu options is \"Leave.\" I hit the hamburger button accidentally very frequently and the subsequent \"Leave\" command is directly where my thumb is when I move the camera. This causes me to leave an instance if I'm not actively paying special attention to avoid hitting the button. Please remove the \"Leave\" option from that menu.",
